### Node/Dependencies ###
# Ignore the massive external dependencies folder
node_modules/
# Log files generated by npm/yarn crashes
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

### Angular Build Outputs ###
# Angular build output directory (Angular 17+)
/.angular/
# Default production build output directory
/dist/
# Angular Universal / Server Side Rendering output
/dist-server/

### Testing & Coverage ###
# Cypress screenshots and videos
/cypress/screenshots/
/cypress/videos/
# Karma and Jest test coverage reports
/coverage/
/.nyc_output/

### IDEs and Editors ###
# JetBrains IDEs (WebStorm, IntelliJ)
.idea/
*.iml
# Visual Studio Code
.vscode/
# Sublime Text
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

### Operating System Files ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### Local Environment/Secrets ###
# Block local environment variables that may contain API keys
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
